# Skip, when a step cannot be done and there is no way back (docs/LEARNING.md "The
# lesson panel"; docs/BUILDING.md "Input scripts"): tutorial 6 at step 9 ("Move") with no
# battle to move in. Next turns into Skip only after ten seconds; after a Skip the next step, whose
# battle is missing too, gets its own ten seconds before Skip comes back (no cascade).
# layouts: both (also plays at 800x600: run_input_tests.py --small)
options --tutorial=combat:9 --layout=1024x768 --size=1280x800

wait-lesson combat
assert-step 9
assert-absent item:"recovery:*" in=lesson
wait 540
assert-absent item:Skip in=lesson
wait-for item:Skip in=lesson timeout=120
click item:Skip in=lesson
wait-step 10
wait 5
assert-absent item:Skip in=lesson
assert-present item:Next in=lesson
assert-disabled item:Next in=lesson
wait 480
assert-absent item:Skip in=lesson
wait-for item:Skip in=lesson timeout=200
